    "detailed_description": "Noah in a Dream is a single-player 3rd-person action-adventure game.<br><br><strong>Story</strong><br><br>Noah was always late to school and was hence bullied by his fellow students and scolded by teachers. This made him emotionally desperate and he always returned home disappointed about his day. His mother often consoled him when she found it. <br> <br>But back in sleep, he had a dream of reaching school on time, passing a fantasy forest where he encountered obstacles like wild animals, deadly humans, and even monsters but he could also see his mother among them which gave him the courage to overcome them.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Platforming</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Puzzles</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Combat with monsters</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214440/extras/6c721bd80b2d521a1dffe6ec01e4033a.poster.avif?t=1704957757\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214440/extras/6c721bd80b2d521a1dffe6ec01e4033a.webm?t=1704957757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214440/extras/6c721bd80b2d521a1dffe6ec01e4033a.mp4?t=1704957757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214440/extras/8b8126110aee2ab391197400055d7dd2.poster.avif?t=1704957757\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214440/extras/8b8126110aee2ab391197400055d7dd2.webm?t=1704957757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214440/extras/8b8126110aee2ab391197400055d7dd2.mp4?t=17049